#: src/postulo/plugins/email_addresses/__init__.py
msgid "Keep more than one address on your account — a personal one, a work one — with any of them signing you in and one of them marked as the one Postulo writes to. Switched off, Postulo offers the primary address alone and stops offering the page for managing the rest. Nothing is deleted: the addresses stay, and an account that already has more than one keeps the page, because taking it away would take away the way back in on the day a work address stops working."
msgstr "Coinnigh níos mó ná seoladh amháin ar do chuntas — ceann pearsanta, ceann oibre — agus is féidir síniú isteach le haon cheann acu, le ceann amháin marcáilte mar an ceann a scríobhann Postulo chuige. Múchta, ní thairgeann Postulo ach an príomhsheoladh agus ní thairgeann sé an leathanach chun an chuid eile a bhainistiú a thuilleadh. Ní scriostar aon rud: fanann na seoltaí, agus coinníonn cuntas a bhfuil níos mó ná seoladh amháin aige cheana an leathanach, mar dá mbainfí é, bhainfí an bealach ar ais isteach an lá a stopann seoladh oibre ag obair."

#: src/postulo/plugins/email_addresses/__init__.py
msgid "Multiple email addresses"
msgstr "Seoltaí ríomhphoist iolracha"
